 a weiqi problem: “Let any man who would lead volunteers show he can read a battle.”\", \"玄德答话之前，先看完榜文。太守招募义兵的告示下面，附着一道围棋题：“欲率义兵者，先请看清此局。”\", \"29f76833fd23\"]]"}]},{"id":257,"name":"spot-1-c1","type":"spot","x":256,"y":235.2,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"node","type":"string","value":"1-c1"},{"name":"label","type":"string","value":""},{"name":"label_zh","type":"string","value":""}]},{"id":258,"name":"spot-1-i1","type":"spot","x":288,"y":299.2,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"node","type":"string","value":"1-i1"},{"name":"label","type":"string","value":""},{"name":"label_zh","type":"string","value":""}]},{"id":259,"name":"npc-1","type":"npc","x":168.0,"y":222.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.elder"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_elder2"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"An old storyteller taps his clapper-board. “Sit, sit! Tales of the Yellow Heaven…”\", \"一位说书老人敲了敲醒木。“坐，坐！且听黄天的故事……”\", \"f3699f2b04c4\"]]"}]},{"id":260,"name":"npc-2","type":"npc","x":296.0,"y":222.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.villager"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_youth"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“They say the Yellow Turbans wear scarves the colour of the earth.”\", \"“听说黄巾贼头上裹的巾，是土黄色的。”\", \"d7d413dc7701\"]]"}]},{"id":261,"name":"npc-3","type":"npc","x":296.0,"y":206.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.woman"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_woman2"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Liu Bei? The sandal-seller? Kind man. Ears down to his shoulders, you know.”\", \"“刘备？那个卖草鞋的？是个好人。耳朵都垂到肩膀了。”\", \"c1f65f6a16dd\"]]"}]},{"id":262,"name":"npc-4","type":"npc","x":200.0,"y":254.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.lady"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_geisha2"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“They say the volunteers march next month. Half the girls in town will be weeping at the gate.”\", \"“听说义兵下月就要出征，城里一半的姑娘都要在城门口哭了。”\", \"19326fb1488e\"]]"}]},{"id":263,"name":"npc-5","type":"npc","x":264.0,"y":174.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.maiden"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_maiden"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“A man nine feet tall, with a face as red as a ripe date, just walked into the inn. Who do you suppose he is?”\", \"“刚才有个身长九尺、面如重枣的大汉进了酒店，你说他是什么人？”\", \"38a5196c7813\"]]"}]},{"id":264,"name":"npc-6","type":"npc","x":408.0,"y":174.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.villager"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_porter"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Zhang Fei sells wine and pork. Loud as thunder, but his heart is good.”\", \"“张飞卖酒杀猪，嗓门像打雷，心肠却好。”\", \"5f4efd5a4000\"]]"}]},{"id":265,"name":"npc-7","type":"npc","x":424.0,"y":238.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.official"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_official"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“The governor wants volunteers. Read the notice.”\", \"“太守在招义兵，你去看看榜文吧。”\", \"cf45e5a5e346\"]]"}]},{"id":266,"name":"npc-8","type":"npc","x":344.0,"y":206.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.elder"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_elder2"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[]"},{"name":"challenge","type":"string","value":"elder"},{"name":"face","type":"string","value":"down"},{"name":"intro","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"An old man sits over a weiqi board in the square. “You have the look of a thinker. Sit, play me one.”\", \"广场上，一位老人守着一张棋盘。“看你像个有心思的人。坐，陪我下一局。”\", \"4ecdecb09fdd\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Ha! Quick eyes. The governor could use a man like you.”\", \"“哈！好眼力。太守正需要你这样的人。”\", \"45bad42af942\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Go on. I'll sit here a while yet, still thinking about that board.”\", \"“去吧。我还要在这儿坐一会儿，琢磨琢磨那盘棋。”\", \"e8e34f26d949\"]]"}]},{"id":267,"name":"npc-9","type":"npc","x":328.0,"y":158.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.villager"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_youth"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[]"},{"name":"challenge","type":"string","value":"innkeeper"},{"name":"intro","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Wine's on the house if you can solve the one my regulars can't.”\", \"“我这儿的老主顾都解不出这道题。你要是解得出，酒钱全免。”\", \"1e2a61c409ea\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Well I never. Drink up, then!”\", \"“真没想到！那就喝吧！”\", \"0c7ce3b42b05\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Still the only one who's cracked it.”\", \"“到现在还只有你一个人解出来。”\", \"504e2fdf0545\"]]"}]},{"id":268,"name":"npc-10","type":"npc","x":408.0,"y":222.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.villager"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_farmer2"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[]"},{"name":"challenge","type":"string","value":"farmer"},{"name":"intro","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Weiqi's like farming: you claim the land, then you have to hold it. Try this.”\", \"“下棋跟种地一样：先占地，还得守得住。试试这道。”\", \"f11a50ad42b8\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Held it, and well.”\", \"“守住了，守得好。”\", \"5bb2afee19de\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Fine soil this year.”\", \"“今年的地真肥。”\", \"e532d04d0e32\"]]"}]},{"id":269,"name":"npc-11","type":"npc","x":488.0,"y":190.4,"width":0,"height":0,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"point":true,"properties":[{"name":"kind","type":"string","value":"folk.noble"},{"name":"sprite","type":"string","value":"f_noble"},{"name":"wander","type":"bool","value":false},{"name":"drawn","type":"bool","value":true},{"name":"say","type":"string","value":"[]"},{"name":"challenge","type":"string","value":"clerk"},{"name":"intro","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"A clerk from the county office looks up. “The magistrate set this one. Nobody here has solved it.”\", \"县衙的一位书吏抬起头。“这道题是县令出的，这里还没人解得出。”\", \"2187a8f509f1\"]]"},{"name":"win","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“Remarkable. I'll tell the magistrate a sandal-seller did it.”\", \"“了不起。我要告诉县令，是个卖草鞋的解出来的。”\", \"7565afd17f49\"]]"},{"name":"done","type":"string","value":"[[\"n\", \"“The magistrate still doesn't believe me.”\", \"“县令到现在还不信我。”\", \"505bdf12da5f\"]]"}]},{"id":270,"name":"exit-lousang-village","type":"exit","x":0,"y":240,"width":16,"height":32,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"lousang-village"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"W"}]},{"id":271,"name":"exit-the-peach-garden","type":"exit","x":656,"y":208,"width":16,"height":32,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"the-peach-garden"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"E"}]},{"id":272,"name":"exit-zhuo-county--inn","type":"exit","x":281.6,"y":157.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"zhuo-county--inn"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":273,"name":"exit-zhuo-county--teahouse","type":"exit","x":193.6,"y":205.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"zhuo-county--teahouse"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":274,"name":"exit-zhuo-county--office","type":"exit","x":441.6,"y":189.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"zhuo-county--office"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":275,"name":"exit-zhuo-county--farm","type":"exit","x":361.6,"y":173.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"zhuo-county--farm"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":276,"name":"exit-zhuo-county--house-1","type":"exit","x":73.6,"y":205.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"zhuo-county--house-1"},{"name":"side","type":"string","value":"N"}]},{"id":277,"name":"exit-zhuo-county--house-2","type":"exit","x":553.6,"y":173.6,"width":12.8,"height":7.2,"rotation":0,"visible":true,"properties":[{"name":"to","type":"string","value":"zhuo-county--house-2"},{"name":"side","type":"string","valu